# This repository's own plugin SHIPS its built bundle: `lib/` above is the DSH
# monorepo's build-output rule, but `dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance/lib/*.js` is
# hand-authored source that must be committed for the plugin to be installable
# from a fresh clone. A later negation wins over the earlier directory rule.
!dsh-plugin-deepseek-balance/lib/